{% extends '_email.txt.twig' %}
{% block subject %}Your {{ app_name }} password was changed{% endblock %}
{% block body -%}
Hello {{ user.name }},

The password of your {{ app_name }} account ({{ user.username }}) was changed on {{ at }}, from {{ ip }}, using a link sent to this address. You were signed out everywhere.

If this was you, there is nothing to do. If it was not, someone has access to your email: contact your administrator at once.
{% endblock %}
